<title>FRANCE: French housing starts fall in 3-mos to end July.</title>
<headline>French housing starts fall in 3-mos to end July.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The French housing ministry gave the following unadjusted figures on housing starts in July.</p>
<p>			     3-mos to end     12-mos to end</p>
<p>				 July 1996     July 1996</p>
<p>HOUSING APPROVED</p>
<p> (total nos)		  77,700	  301,800</p>
<p> (y/y pct chg)		  -6.3	     -13.2</p>
<p> STARTED			66,700	  276,400</p>
<p> (percent)			-6.3	     -7.8</p>
<p>NON-HOUSE BUILDING</p>
<p>APPROVED</p>
<p> (sq metres)		 9.01 million	33.56 million</p>
<p> (y/y pct chg)		  -8.9	     -4.5</p>
<p> STARTED		     7.87 million	31.65 million</p>
<p> (percent)			+0.2	     +0.9</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
